s9-p15 = prose (cons "At the other end of the spectrum, a target may be an x86-64 process, GPU kernel, network protocol, or whole machine. Their semantics include calling conventions, layouts, floating-point rules, loader behavior, world interactions, and observable costs. Compilation and interpretation can be represented and checked in the same language; their correctness is conditional on the actual target semantics supplied." nil)
